  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/750/675/wizards_full.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>🧙🏻‍♂️ 用奥术、火焰与霜冻魔法消灭你的敌人！</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Spell Engine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索 RPG 系列的更多作品</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盗贼\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装</h1>\n<h3>必需</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AzureLib Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-crafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Runes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>强烈推荐</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 用于实现更完善的武器机制</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>🧙🏻‍♂️ 特性</h1>\n<p>本项目添加了以 RPG 风格战斗为核心的技能组——通常称为职业——并引入了多种法师原型变体（灵感来源于《魔兽世界》）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/104/pyroblast-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>入门指南</h2>\n<p>获取一把<strong>魔杖</strong>或<strong>法杖</strong>，它们都附带基础法术。</p>\n<p><strong>符文</strong>作为施放法术的弹药（类似于弓的箭矢）。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-crafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">了解关于制作符文的更多信息。</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/41/craft_wand-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>法术书</h2>\n<p>通过制作一本法术书，解锁其中强大的法术，成为真正的法师吧！</p>\n<p>要做到这一点，请在村庄建筑 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gazebos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gazebos</a> 中找到法术装订台，或者自行建造（别忘了在法术装订台周围放置书架）。</p>\n<p>使用法术书的方法：装备它并手持武器！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/45/spell_binding-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>奥术之典</h3>\n<p>提供专注的奥术法术，最适合对付单独行动或聚集在一起的敌人。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1340/985/arcane_beam-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>火焰之典</h3>\n<p>提供狂暴的火焰法术，最适合在大范围内造成大量伤害。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1340/987/fire-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>霜冻之典</h3>\n<p>提供凛冽的霜冻法术，最适合伤害敌人、阻碍其移动并为自身提供护盾。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1340/986/blizzard-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>法师装备</h2>\n<p>探索可制作的装备，提升你法术的威力与速度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各类按材质分级的法师长袍</li>\n<li>各类按材质分级的法杖与魔杖</li>\n</ul>\n<p>装备加成可在 <code>config/wizards/items.json</code> 中进行配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/257/equipment-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>魔法附魔</h2>\n<p>解锁强大的施法附魔，例如：</p>\n<p><strong>无限法术</strong> 无需消耗符文即可施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>法术强化</strong> 全面提升法术伤害</p>\n<p><strong>急速施法</strong> 提高法术施放速度</p>\n<p>在游戏中发现更多吧！使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a> 查看详细说明！</p>\n<p>附魔配置位于 <code>config/spell_power/enchantments.json</code>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/43/enchanting-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>扩展地牢战利品</h2>\n<p>在地牢战利品箱中找到魔法装备吧！</p>\n<p>战利品表注入可在 <code>config/rpg_series/loot.json</code> 中配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/44/loot_chest-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>新的村庄建筑</h2>\n<p>在村庄中寻找法师塔，法师商人村民会在其中出售魔法装备！</p>\n<p>生成权重与数量上限可在 <code>config/wizards/villages.json</code> 中配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1341/46/towers_cropped-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>🔧 配置</h1>\n<p>施法机制与 HUD 可在 <strong>Mod Menu / Spell Engine / Settings</strong> 中进行配置。</p>\n<p>所有法术均在数据文件中定义，因此可通过数据包进行自定义。你可以在本页面链接的项目源代码中找到原始数据文件。</p>\n<p>法师装备的物品属性、宝箱战利品概率以及村庄结构生成，均可通过修改 <code>config/wizards/</code> 下的配置文件来实现。</p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1>\n<p>创建你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能支持我们。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>发现由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的各类 Spell Engine 模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"Anarchy\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"雇佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力导师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
